 * Allocations.jsx — CLIENT + VENDOR + CHECK ALLOCATION
 *
 * Existing client/vendor allocation logic is preserved.
 * Added check allocation (3rd mode):
 *   - Client allocation saves in: clientAllocations_${adminEmail}
